   "title": "Newspaper vocabulary added",
   "text": "74,663 of the reference words come from a newspaper corpus (Leipzig Corpora Collection, hye_newscrawl_2011_100K, 1.6 million words); 10,596 come from the subtitle list. Written sources are more formal than subtitles and contain more names and foreign words. Frequencies of the corpus-only words come from that corpus and are not comparable with subtitle frequencies."
